@startuml SmartAutoCar_Block
!theme plain
title Smart Auto — High-level block diagram (app + Supabase + externals)

rectangle "Flutter app (Smart Auto)" as Flutter #E8EEFF
rectangle "Supabase Auth" as SBAuth #E0F0E8
rectangle "PostgreSQL + RLS" as PG #E0F0E8
rectangle "Storage buckets" as ST #E0F0E8
rectangle "Realtime" as RT #E0F0E8
rectangle "Maps / Places" as Maps #FFF4E0
rectangle "AI (Gemini)" as GenAI #FFF4E0

Flutter --> SBAuth : JWT session
Flutter --> PG : PostgREST
Flutter --> ST : files
Flutter --> RT : WebSocket
Flutter --> Maps : location
Flutter --> GenAI : diagnosis

SBAuth .. PG : profile sync
PG .. ST : URLs in rows
PG .. RT : live data

note bottom of PG
  Tables: profiles, issues, requests,
  request_responses, chats, messages
end note

@enduml
